msgctxt "64"
msgid "I'm warning you. I've got a bodyguard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Don't be like that, babe. You need the pocket change, don't you? Well, I got"
" the perfect gig in mind for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Come on, man, can't you see she's not interested? Lemme show you what "
"happens when you don't leave innocent girls alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"The hell's your problem, dude? Keep your paws outta other people's business!"
" Ugh, I'm outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Thanks, Rikiya. I don't know what I'd do without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking the same thing. What's with all the trouble you keep "
"runnin' into, Akiho-san? Maybe Kamurocho's just too dangerous for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I mean, yeah, it's dangerous, but now I have my knight in shining armor here"
" to take care of me! It's... really nice having you around, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Well, I wanna help, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Anyway, I've gotta run! Drop by the club again sometime, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Rikiya... Doesn't it sort of feel like she's using you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Akiho-san, using me? You've gotta get your head checked, Aniki. She'd never "
"do that. I mean, I'm from Okinawa, she's from Okinawa. We're just lookin' "
"out for each other!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "...If you say so."
msgstr "...Se lo dici tu."

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Still, something doesn't seem quite right to me. I have a feeling she'll be "
"in trouble again before long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"She probably hasn't gone far, now that I think about it. Why don't we keep "
"an eye on her and see what happens?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"C'mon, we don't have to do that. Akiho-san'll ring me up if she's in trouble"
" again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr "Non lo so..."

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Don't be such a droopy dragon, Aniki! Hey, the night's still young, right? "
"We got plenty more sightseeing to do! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

